=========================================
  AUSTOURS - Window Hierarchy
=========================================

main.java
└── MainWindow.java  (JFrame)
    │
    ├──Tab: "Summary Panel"
    │
    ├── Tab: "Hotels"
    │   └── HotelPanel.java  (JPanel)
    │       ├── [Button: ADD HOTEL]
    │       │   └── AddEditHotelWindow.java  (JFrame)
    │       │       └── Saves to hotels.txt via HotelPanel.saveAlltoFile()
    │       │
    │       └── [Button: EDIT HOTEL]
    │           └── AddEditHotelWindow.java  (JFrame)  -- same window, isEditing = true
    │               └── Updates existing row + saves to hotels.txt
    │
    └── Tab: "Occupancy"
        └── OccupancyPanel.java  (JPanel)
            └── [Button: ADD OCCUPANCY]
                └── AddOccupancyWindow.java  (JFrame)
                    └── Appends to occupancy.txt via OccupancyPanel.fillTable()
=========================================
  Files Used
=========================================

  hotels.txt     → Master data (Hotels)
  occupancy.txt  → Transactional data (Occupancy per month)
=========================================
  User Stories Covered
=========================================

  US-1  -> Summary
  US-3  → AddHotelWindow  (Add new hotel)
  US-4  → HotelPanel      (List all hotels + save to file)
  US-5  → AddHotelWindow  (Edit existing hotel, isEditing = true)
  US-6  → AddOccupancyWindow (Add new occupancy data)
  US-10 → OccupancyPanel  (List occupancy data with filters)

=========================================
